<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="hero-title">看见彼此</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">关注亲友的计划，进度会被认真对待。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">我关注的计划</view>
  <view class="empty card" wx:if="{{emptyWatch}}">
    <text>还没有关注别人。让亲友把计划分享给你，点「关注这份计划」即可。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="plan-list" wx:else>
    <plan-card
      wx:for="{{watching}}"
      wx:key="_id"
      plan="{{item}}"
      bind:open="onOpen"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">关注我的计划</view>
  <view class="empty card" wx:if="{{emptyMine}}">
    <text>先在「今日」制定一份计划，再分享给亲友。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="plan-list" wx:else>
    <plan-card
      wx:for="{{myPlans}}"
      wx:key="_id"
      plan="{{item}}"
      extra="{{item.watcherText}}"
      bind:open="onOpen"
    />
  </view>
</view>
